status GREEN -- crushed_index GREEN, 58 control legs zero fail, scan verdict ok over 522 pages; shell_dialect GREEN; both touched programs grade A 90 and B+ 87; cold pass invalidated by my own mid-run edits, hot pass is the receipt
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- one ask: `lessons/README.md` counts a room from an undeclared title. Declare the page an index, which hands it the member walk and the title ban together, or widen the title reading to every room door under a deep-declared room and accept one pronoun false-refusal in three?
